# Unity / Git 协作规范（两台 Windows 开发机通用）
# 放在第一行的是注释，确保任何编码问题都不会破坏下面的规则。

# ---- 行尾策略 ----
# 仓库内统一存 LF，Windows 检出为 CRLF（等价于 core.autocrlf=true 的现状，
# 避免两个人机器配置不同时产生“整文件都是改动”的假 diff）
* text=auto

# C# 源码
*.cs text diff=csharp

# ---- Unity YAML 资源：冲突时用 UnityYAMLMerge 智能合并 ----
# 需要每台机器执行一次配置（见 README「场景冲突怎么办」），未配置时自动退回 Git 默认合并，不会报错
*.unity              merge=unityyamlmerge
*.prefab             merge=unityyamlmerge
*.asset              merge=unityyamlmerge
*.meta               merge=unityyamlmerge
*.controller         merge=unityyamlmerge
*.overrideController merge=unityyamlmerge
*.anim               merge=unityyamlmerge
*.mat                merge=unityyamlmerge
*.physicMaterial     merge=unityyamlmerge
*.physicsMaterial2D  merge=unityyamlmerge

# ---- 二进制资源：不做行尾转换、不做文本合并 ----
*.png           binary
*.jpg           binary
*.jpeg          binary
*.gif           binary
*.psd           binary
*.tga           binary
*.tif           binary
*.exr           binary
*.hdr           binary
*.fbx           binary
*.obj           binary
*.blend         binary
*.ogg           binary
*.mp3           binary
*.wav           binary
*.aiff          binary
*.ttf           binary
*.otf           binary
*.dll           binary
*.so            binary
*.dylib         binary
*.a             binary
*.bundle        binary
*.unitypackage  binary
*.cubemap       binary
*.mp4           binary
*.webm          binary
